      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20096/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together hash browns, condensed soup, sour cream, Cheddar cheese, and ham in a bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/b1CbMi5monOCnmrc-ETEo0nql_k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-20096-cheesy-ham-and-hash-brown-casserole-VAT-step-02-574555ed685042af802f8e1c7dfb3a14.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20096/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread evenly into the prepared dish. Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
